# AuralMind2 ignore rules
# Purpose: keep source, docs, tests, and runner manifests visible while excluding
# heavy generated audio, local env files, caches, SQLite runtime state, and logs.
# Data shapes: audio exports (*.wav/*.mp3/etc), JSON/DB runtime state, Python cache
# directories, and local-only environment/config artifacts.
# Important runtime paths: server.py:3284 premium trap resource,
# server.py:3424 premium trap prompt, server.py:3787 run_master_job,
# server.py:3815 job_status, server.py:3987 master_audio, and
# tools/auralmind_maestro.py:2804 master.
# Possible bugs: over-broad ignores can hide source fixtures; tracked audio already
# in Git remains tracked until explicitly removed with git rm.
# Extensions: 1) add a curated fixtures allowlist for tiny test audio, 2) move
# release deliverables to a separate artifact store instead of the repo tree.

# Local secrets and environment
.env
.venv/
maestro_sessions/

# Python/editor caches
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.pyright/
.test_tmp*/
tests/_runtime_*/

# Generated audio and DAW sidecars
*.wav
*.mp3
*.flac
*.aif
*.aiff
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.asd
*.reapeaks

# Curated tiny test audio fixtures are the only audio allowed back into Git.
!tests/fixtures/audio/
!tests/fixtures/audio/.gitignore
!tests/fixtures/audio/README.md
!tests/fixtures/audio/*.wav
!tests/fixtures/audio/*.flac
!tests/fixtures/audio/*.mp3

# Runtime logs, state, and generated outputs
*.log
server.log
runtime_validation.json
sonic_specs.json
data/*.log
data/*.md
data/ui_uploads/
data/complete/
data/codex_mastered/
data/maestro_state.db
artifacts/
manifests/
masters/
masters_premium_trap20_*/
Album_Ignorance_is_bliss/
Ignorance Is Bliss/
mastering/peaks/
